  "energy_arc": "Sec 1 (Intro Alaap, 3 bars): Dark, solemn, exposed sitar exploration in the mandra register over tanpura drone (low intensity, 25%).\nSec 2 (Riff, 2 bars): Massive progressive band entrance, tight palm-muted low-end groove locking to Teentaal sam (high intensity, 70%).\nSec 3 (Melody, 2 bars): Sitar hook enters singing over the main riff, intertwining raga nuances with metal drive (75%).\nSec 4 (Melody Chorus, 2 bars): Clean arpeggios expand the harmony as the sitar soars into the madhya register (80%).\nSec 5 (Breakdown, 2 bars): Crushing, syncopated rhythm crush dwelling on d-P tension with double-kick punches (88%).\nSec 6 (Taan Long, 2 bars): Climactic virtuosic sitar taan driven by full-throttle rhythm gallop and cymbal wash (peak intensity, 95%).\nSec 7 (Outro, 2 bars): Final thematic reprise driving with heavy stabs directly into an abrupt hard stop on Sam (90% to silence)."
